===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# In a [[mechanical]] manner.
#* {{RQ:Cleland Fanny Hill|passage=My fears, however, made me '''mechanically''' close my thighs; but the very touch of his hand insinuated between them, disclosed them and opened a way for the main attack.}}
#* {{RQ:Landon Ethel Churchill|pages=183–184|volume=II|passage="Of what avail," and her eyes wandered '''mechanically''' round, "is all the luxury by which I am surrounded, if it serve only as a barrier to all kindly feelings?"}}

